file: macros/src/block.rs
breaks: A field that names a partial block's trait with more or fewer path segments than the block's header is one name spelled two ways, reported on the header, as `docs/decisions/a-fields-trait-may-be-a-partial-blocks.md` and `docs/limits.md` say.
expect: killed
witness: s0=struct-trait-spelt s1=none path=block

find:
entries.spelt_otherwise(trait_path, &attributes)
replace:
entries.spelt_otherwise(trait_path, &attributes).filter(|_| false)
